<header class="page-head">
  <p class="crumbs"><a href="{{ root }}index.html">Capsid Hub</a> / Method</p>
  <h1>Method</h1>
  <p class="lede">How an image in this hub is specified, built, published and checked, and what that does and does
    not guarantee. The engine's own documentation gives the full reference.</p>
</header>

<nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
